{"file":"GrowthBook Skills-2.0.0-v1.zip","bytes":183508,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"growthbook","description":"Domain skills for the full GrowthBook feature flag, experimentation, and product analytics lifecycle.","version":"2.0.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/growthbook/skills","keywords":["growthbook","feature-flags","experimentation","ab-testing"]},{"path":".cursor-plugin/plugin.json","name":"growthbook","displayName":"GrowthBook","description":"Full-lifecycle agent skills for GrowthBook feature flags, experimentation, and product analytics.","version":"2.0.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/growthbook/skills","homepage":"https://www.growthbook.io","keywords":["growthbook","feature-flags","experimentation","ab-testing"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/analytics/SKILL.md","name":"analytics","description":"Chart GrowthBook product data, build Analytics dashboards, manage the metric catalog, or query the warehouse directly — run Product Analytics explorations, save charts together on a dashboard, search metrics and fact tables, create fact metrics and their fact tables, or fall back to ad-hoc SQL. Use for \"show me signups by country\", \"chart daily active users\", \"how many orders last week\", \"build me a dashboard\", \"put these metrics on a dashboard\", \"add a chart to this dashboard\", \"set up reporting for X\", \"find our revenue metric\", \"what fact tables exist\", \"create a metric\", \"define a metric on the orders table\", \"what tables contain user data\", \"run a SQL query\", or any \"show me / chart / plot / how many\" question about product data. For an A/B test's results or choosing experiment metrics, use experiments. For feature flags, use feature-flags. For first-time API key configuration, use gb-setup.","headings":["analytics","Pick a workflow","Shared conventions","Read-only vs. write","Handoffs"],"name_hint":"analytics","description_zh":"分析 GrowthBook 产品数据、生成图表与仪表盘、管理指标目录和事实表，支持产品分析探索、事实指标创建与临时 SQL；实验结果、功能标记和首次密钥配置交由对应技能。"},{"path":"skills/experiments/SKILL.md","name":"experiments","description":"Design, launch, analyze, and stop GrowthBook A/B tests, and search or record durable Learnings across experiments. Use for experiments, split tests, variations, hypotheses, sample size, guardrail metrics, SRM, chance to win, lift, declaring a winner, \"what have we learned\", \"have we tested this before\", or \"record this learning\". For bandits, identify them and direct the user to GrowthBook UI. For feature flags and rollouts, use feature-flags. For product analytics or metric catalog work, use analytics. For API key configuration, use gb-setup.","headings":["experiments","Pick a workflow","Methodology authority","Shared conventions","Read-only vs. write","Budget","Handoffs"],"name_hint":"experiments","description_zh":"设计、启动、分析和停止 GrowthBook A/B 实验，查询记录持久经验，涵盖假设、样本量、保护指标、SRM、胜出概率和提升；多臂老虎机引导到 UI，功能灰度与产品分析交由其他技能。"},{"path":"skills/feature-flags/SKILL.md","name":"feature-flags","description":"Read and modify GrowthBook feature flags — create, search, toggle, target, schedule, ramp, monitor, publish drafts, and archive. Use when the user mentions a feature flag, feature toggle, kill switch, rollout, targeting rule, percentage release, saved group, prerequisite, draft revision, flag approval, or flag cleanup. Triggers include \"create a flag for X\", \"release this to 10% of users\", \"turn on flag X in production\", \"gradually roll this out\", \"publish this draft\", \"what flags do we have\", \"who needs to approve this\", and \"delete this stale flag\". For designing, launching, analyzing, or stopping an A/B test, use the experiments skill. For charting product data or browsing the metric catalog, use the analytics skill. For first-time API key configuration, use gb-setup.","headings":["feature-flags","Pick a workflow","Shared conventions","Failure modes","Read-only vs. write","Budget","Handoffs"],"name_hint":"feature · flags","description_zh":"读取修改 GrowthBook 功能标记，创建搜索、开关、定向、排程、渐进发布、监控、发布草稿和归档，处理保存分组、前提条件及批准；A/B 测试、数据图表和首次认证交由对应技能。"},{"path":"skills/gb-setup/SKILL.md","name":"gb-setup","description":"Configure GrowthBook API credentials and the trusted app origin so the other skills can run and link to the UI. Use when the user says \"set up growthbook\", \"configure my api key\", \"growthbook isn't working\", \"where do I put my key\", or when another skill emits an error pointing here (\"GB_API_KEY is not set\", \"authentication failed\", \"GB_APP_URL is required\"). Writes ~/.config/growthbook/.env with chmod 600 and validates against the live API. For listing flags or running experiments, the domain skills handle that.","headings":["gb-setup","Workflow","Guardrails","File format reference","Endpoints used","Handoffs"],"name_hint":"gb · 设置","description_zh":"配置 GrowthBook API 凭据与可信应用来源，把配置写入权限600的 ~/.config/growthbook/.env 并用实时 API 验证，用于缺失 GB_API_KEY、认证失败或 GB_APP_URL 错误。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["GrowthBook Agent Skills","What's included","`feature-flags`","`experiments`","`analytics`","`gb-setup`","Install","1. Install the plugin","2. Configure credentials","3. Verify","How to invoke","What these skills do not do","How it works","Repository layout","Security & secrets","Contributing","License"]},{"path":"scripts/README.md","headings":["scripts/","`gb-call`","Usage","Configuration","Output","Error catalog","Why this helper exists","Not in scope (yet)"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".cursor-plugin/plugin.json",".gitignore","CHANGELOG.md","CLAUDE.md","LICENSE","README.md","scripts/README.md","scripts/gb-call","scripts/gb-call.test.mjs","skills/analytics/SKILL.md","skills/analytics/references/analytics-explore.md","skills/analytics/references/dashboard-create.md","skills/analytics/references/dashboard-edit.md","skills/analytics/references/metric-create.md","skills/analytics/ref